# Virtual Car Configurator — 3D Interactive Automotive Experience

## 1. Project Overview

Build a premium, highly interactive 3D Virtual Car Configurator and Digital Showroom.

The website should feel like a futuristic luxury automotive website rather than a traditional car dealership website.

The core experience is a fully interactive 3D vehicle that users can rotate, zoom, inspect, customize, and configure in real time.

The website should combine:

- 3D graphics
- Real-time vehicle customization
- Cinematic animations
- Interactive UI
- Dynamic pricing
- AI-powered configuration recommendations
- Car comparison
- Configuration saving and sharing
- Responsive design
- Premium automotive visual design

The final result should be suitable as a high-end Full Stack + AI + 3D portfolio project.

