## 16. AI API Architecture

Keep API keys secure.

Never expose API keys inside frontend code.

Use a backend API endpoint such as:

```
POST /api/ai/configure
```

The frontend sends the user's request.

The backend communicates with the AI provider.

The backend returns structured configuration data.

### Example structure

```json
{
  "paint": "metallic-blue",
  "wheels": "sport-20",
  "interior": "black-leather",
  "brakes": "red",
  "package": "sport"
}
```

Validate the AI response before applying it to the vehicle.

